'''Floral Kalisa''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]] gacha event. She is an [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] variant of [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]] added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 737
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Floral Kalisa
|name2 = Floral Kalisa, type χ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Floral Kalisa, type χ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Compared to normal [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]], Floral Kalisa has the same HP, and can also move faster, but has lower base damage and less standing range. Unlike Kalisa, she has Massive Damage against Zombies rather than Angels and as such has Zombie Killer to go along with this change. She also gains Immune to Slow and Immune to Curse in her Evolved Form.

In terms of effectiveness, Zombies may burrow past her when she isn't attacking them, but she can absolutely smoke all Zombies who dare stand in front of her with strong burst damage. Her Immune to Slow makes her a particularly good pick against [[Daboo of the Dead]], as well as [[Lord Gravey]] and [[Zamelle]] who are unable to Burrow past her.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Nuker}}

